# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages: cross-origin isolation lets the on-device AI
# use several CPU threads. GitHub Pages ignores this file; there the switch in
# the AI app (Offline and install -> Multi-threading) does the same job.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
